{"parentUuid":"d302b140-67b5-4f82-b9ae-21b6c158c2f3","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"c8cdae05-aaaa-4408-8a9a-59c4a4939d97","agentId":"a43e97232d861bfd4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YKpAnHaJgJALkpj9Q87w9R","type":"tool_result","content":"# CP-SAT Production Deployment Analysis\n\nBased on the PDF content provided, I found **limited specific industrial deployment information**. The document appears to be a presentation about CP-SAT for scheduling, but the actual deployment details are sparse.\n\n## Key Findings:\n\n**Industrial Deployment Mentions:**\n- No specific company case studies are detailed in the searchable text\n- No explicit real-world production company names are mentioned\n- The document references academic papers and YouTube resources but doesn't elaborate on their industrial applications\n\n**Technical Parameters:**\n- No specific mentions of `num_workers` settings\n- No `linearization_level` parameter values documented\n- No `search_branching` parameter configurations provided\n- No time budget specifications (seconds/minutes/hours) for production use cases\n\n**Problem Scale Details:**\n- Problem sizes used in production are not specified in the accessible content\n- The PDF contains compressed/encoded content sections that may contain deployment examples, but these are not readable in the extracted text\n\n## Recommendations:\nTo obtain production deployment information about CP-SAT, you would need to:\n1. Consult Google OR-Tools official documentation\n2. Review the referenced academic papers (particularly the PDF link mentioned: \"people.eng.unimelb.edu.au\")\n3. Check the YouTube video resource linked in the presentation\n4. Contact Google OR-Tools community forums or documentation directly\n\nThe presentation appears educational rather than operationally focused on real-world deployments.\n\n[Binary content (application/pdf, 325.6KB) also saved to C:\\Users\\22957\\.claude\\projects\\D--claude-pj-zmd\\