{"parentUuid":"49d0f484-379d-4893-b46a-6cdabf7228d9","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a43e97232d861bfd4","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01Pk19FT9QU7PnRUnQmqzmSz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Y1jkirpTvkhEnHCPsCmZ1H","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"\"or-tools\" \"cp-sat\" jobs site:linkedin.com OR site:greenhouse.io engineer"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7265,"cache_read_input_tokens":41688,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7265,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":46,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CaotvuYioVPpx7bFYQgHu","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"880b8515-781c-4d2a-aa21-de86bb53b057","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:11:30.451Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"5e64fe07-0709-4f1b-8085-99468a44a0f1","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0f373ebb-a92e-4bba-8942-d03ed7b7aa78","agentId":"a43e97232d861bfd4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CGawRDnboSAwt4haQ4DF1K","type":"tool_result","content":"# CP-SAT Production Use Cases from HN Comments\n\nBased on the discussion thread, here are the documented production implementations:\n\n## Documented Use Cases\n\n**1. Sports Camp Scheduling**\n- User: d_burfoot\n- Quote: \"I have a client that runs a sports camp for kids. The kids get to request what sports they want to play, and what friends they want to be in class with.\"\n- Implementation: Connected camp data to an OR-Tools optimizer\n- Impact: Reduced scheduling from several man-weeks annually to \"a few clicks\"\n\n**2. Basketball League Management**\n- User: jgalt212\n- Problem: Managing playing time constraints across 8 periods with equal distribution requirements\n- Scale: Multiple games with late arrivals and no-shows requiring dynamic adjustments\n- Challenge noted: Finding near-optimal lineups across a season while respecting constraints\n\n**3. Bin Packing Problem**\n- User: flats\n- Tool: OR-Tools CP-SAT solver via Ruby wrapper\n- Support: Used ChatGPT to refine constraint and objective definitions\n\n## Key Observations\n\nNo comments detailed specific time budgets, tuning configurations, or performance metrics. The examples focus on problem feasibility rather than optimization benchmarks. Users emphasized that constraint modeling itself—rather than solver execution—represents the primary implementation challenge."}]},"uuid":"48312055-bdb3-45f2-bd86-5030b412123a","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:11:35.077Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5e64fe07-0709-4f1b-8085-99468a44a0f1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"880b8515-781c-4d2a-aa21-de86bb53b057","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0f373ebb-a92e-4bba-8942-d03ed7b7aa78","agentId":"a43e97232d861bfd4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Y1jkirpTvkhEnHCPsCmZ1H","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"or-tools\" \"cp-sat\" jobs site:linkedin.com OR site:greenhouse.io engineer\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Google OR Tools\",\"url\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/google-tools-vysakh-m-kartha\"},{\"title\":\"Dominik Krupke - Technische Universität Braunschweig | LinkedIn\",\"url\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/dominik-krupke-9869b2241/\"}]\n\nThe search results returned some information about OR-Tools and CP-SAT, but did not return specific job listings from LinkedIn or Greenhouse.io. The results included a general article about Google OR-Tools and a LinkedIn profile mentioning work with CP-SAT, but no current job postings matching your query.\n\nTo find job openings for engineers skilled in OR-Tools and CP-SAT on LinkedIn or Greenhouse.io, you may want to try:\n\n1. **Visiting the job boards directly** and using their native search functionality with terms like \"or-tools\", \"CP-SAT\", and \"optimization engineer\"\n2. **Browsing company career pages** - companies that use these optimization tools (like logistics, supply chain, or operations research firms) often post jobs directly\n3. **Adjusting your search** - the site-specific search operators may have limited results for this specific technical combination\n\nThese tools are used primarily in optimization research, vehicle routing, scheduling, and combinatorial optimization roles, so targeting companies in those industries may yield better results.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"fcad7b90-2098-4726-b505-9511373f19d0","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:11:36.194Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"880b8515-781c-4d2a-aa21-de86bb53b057","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"eb81a36e-44b3-4e92-aa9d-e5f70eed21e4","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0f373ebb-a92e-4bba-8942-d03ed7b7aa78","agentId":"a43e97232d861bfd4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TTJFUpL4wrmtaBvxwXrW33","type":"tool_result","content":"# Google OR-Tools CP-SAT Analysis from Feasible Article #76\n\n## Company Information\nThe article is from **Feasible**, a newsletter by Borja Menéndez focused on optimization and operations research.\n\n## Production Use Cases\nThe author discusses solving **planning and logistics problems** with CP-SAT, specifically mentioning:\n- Capacitated Vehicle Routing Problems (VRP) with time windows\n- Task scheduling with interval variables\n- Worker assignment and rostering problems\n\n## Problem Characteristics (Not Specific Scale)\nThe article focuses on problem types rather than concrete scales:\n- Numerous boolean decision variables\n- Integer variables with small domains\n- Logic constraints with nonlinear relationships\n\n## Parameter Tuning & Configuration\nLimited specifics provided, but mentions:\n- \"A portfolio of sub-solvers, several decision strategies\" are configurable\n- The solver includes \"Large-Neighborhood Search, and automatic restarts\"\n- Big-M constants can be \"automatically computed\" by CP-SAT\n\n## Key Modeling Lessons (3+ Years Experience)\n1. **Hints vs. warm-starts differ** — hints must cover all touched variables and remain feasible post-presolve or are silently ignored\n2. **Interval variables recommended** — \"Use `IntervalVars` whenever possible\" for scheduling with built-in cumulative/overlap constraints\n3. **Conditional logic trade-offs** — `OnlyEnforceIf` adds Big-M constraints that can weaken propagation; native boolean logic preferred when possible\n\n## Documentation Challenge\nThe author criticizes: \"Documentation. It's terrible. You can read everywhere that docs are quite sparse.\""}]},"uuid":"e7743a7b-3793-43f9-a07a-c06933f0315f","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:11:36.645Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"eb81a36e-44b3-4e92-aa9d-e5f70eed21e4","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"49d0f484-379d-4893-b46a-6cdabf7228d9","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0f373ebb-a92e-4bba-8942-d03ed7b7aa78","agentId":"a43e97232d861bfd4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BCC7hwx9tYEdfgg1MXUcxY","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"OR-Tools\" CP-SAT delivery routing logistics company \"in production\" deployment Lyft Instacart\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Is Google OR tools applicable to solve VRP (vehicle routing problem) in the production environment? - Quora\",\"url\":\"https://www.quora.com/Is-Google-OR-tools-applicable-to-solve-VRP-vehicle-routing-problem-in-the-production-environment\"},{\"title\":\"I’m a bit uncertain about what Google OR-Tools is…it *seems* to be some sort of ... | Hacker News\",\"url\":\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=22582688\"},{\"title\":\"Making Grocery Delivery Tech Work at Kroger, Walmart, Instacart, and Shipt | Canopy Remote Device Management Software\",\"url\":\"https://www.gocanopy.com/news-insights/grocery-delivery-kroger-walmart-instacart-shipt\"},{\"title\":\"Instacart Logistics Optimization: 7 Proven Strategies Revolutionizing Grocery Delivery in 2025\",\"url\":\"https://careerswami.com/instacart-logistics-optimization/\"},{\"title\":\"Best Logistics Software: 5 Top Tools for Route Planning & Delivery\",\"url\":\"https://smartroutes.io/blogs/logistics-software/\"},{\"title\":\"Routing Software | CARTO\",\"url\":\"https://carto.com/routing-software/\"},{\"title\":\"ToolsInfo - Build & Scale Your Business with the Right Tools\",\"url\":\"https://logistics.toolsinfo.com/c/same-day-delivery-software/guide\"},{\"title\":\"Food Delivery Apps & Platforms: Trends, Challenges, and Automation | dev.family\",\"url\":\"https://dev.family/blog/article/on-demand-food-delivery-platforms-market-trends-and-opportunities\"},{\"title\":\"How Instacart Built Its On-Demand Grocery Delivery Service | StackShare\",\"url\":\"https://stackshare.io/posts/the-tech-behind-instacarts-grocery-delivery-service\"},{\"title\":\"SmartRoutes | Streamline your Entire Delivery Process | Route Planner\",\"url\":\"https://smartroutes.io/\"}]\n\nI found some relevant information from my search. Here are the key findings related to OR-Tools, CP-SAT, and its use in delivery routing logistics:\n\n## OR-Tools and CP-SAT Overview\n\nThe CP-SAT solver has consistently won the Minizinc challenge the last few years and the routing library is a great local search framework. OR-Tools is a package of tools that are for solving combinatorial optimization problems, with most of the working code written in C++ and can be plugged into other languages.\n\n## Production Use in Delivery Logistics\n\nGoogle's OR-Tools GitHub Repository is an excellent starting point—complete with code samples for TSP variants and vehicle routing solvers for companies working on delivery optimization. The search results show that Instacart faces the vehicle routing problem daily (the Stochastic Capacitated Vehicle Routing Problem with Time Windows, Multiple Trips) and must assign batches of orders to shoppers, route them through stores and homes, and adapt to curveballs like sudden rain or a shopper calling out sick.\n\n## Company Usage\n\nWhile the search results confirm that data scientists from companies such as Instacart, Postmates & Delivery.com use routing services for their last-mile delivery analysis, the specific information about whether Lyft or Instacart are currently using OR-Tools CP-SAT \"in production\" was not directly addressed in these search results. The results indicate these companies use advanced routing and optimization systems, but don't explicitly confirm OR-Tools CP-SAT deployment at either company.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"fe0dcb93-6421-440f-bb93-e5e3b7027b63","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:11:37.339Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"49d0f484-379d-4893-b46a-6cdabf7228d9","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
