{"parentUuid":"0c0bd1a8-792b-4cbf-b673-94ab69c3836f","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0da025bf-5462-4d88-9ddf-73d39057a5ff","agentId":"a43e97232d861bfd4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JnKWUfS1KCMBvj9eku2g3H","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"CP-SAT\" Microsoft datacenter VM placement rack scheduling production\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Bin Repacking Scheduling in Virtualized Datacenters\",\"url\":\"https://fhermeni.github.io/pubs/hermenier-etal-cp2011.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"VM Placement - an overview | ScienceDirect Topics\",\"url\":\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/topics/computer-science/vm-placement\"},{\"title\":\"Resource Central: Understanding and Predicting ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Resource-Central-SOSP17.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Virtual Machine Placement - an overview | ScienceDirect Topics\",\"url\":\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/topics/computer-science/virtual-machine-placement\"},{\"title\":\"Multi-Criteria Virtual Machine Placement in Cloud ...\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1802.05113\"},{\"title\":\"VM Placement | SolverForge\",\"url\":\"https://solverforge.org/docs/getting-started/vm-placement/\"},{\"title\":\"Demystifying System Center Virtual Machine Manager (SCVMM)\",\"url\":\"https://www.smikar.com/what-is-scvmm/\"},{\"title\":\"The SAP Cloud Infrastructure Dataset\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.23911\"},{\"title\":\"Workload Placement in VMware Cloud Foundation: Smarter VM Deployment for Performance and Efficiency - VMware Cloud Foundation (VCF) Blog\",\"url\":\"https://blogs.vmware.com/cloud-foundation/2025/11/05/vmware-cloud-foundation-workload-placement/\"},{\"title\":\"Virtual Processor Scheduling - VMware & Microsoft - FlackBox\",\"url\":\"https://www.flackbox.com/virtual-processor-scheduling-how-vmware-and-microsoft-hypervisors-work-at-the-cpu-level\"}]\n\nThe search results provide general information about VM placement and datacenter scheduling, but they don't specifically address CP-SAT in relation to Microsoft datacenter VM placement and rack scheduling in production environments. \n\nThe results cover:\n- Constraint Programming (CP) approaches to VM placement in datacenters\n- General VM placement algorithms and strategies\n- Microsoft Azure's resource management and scheduling\n- Various datacenter scheduling techniques\n\nHowever, none of the results directly mention CP-SAT (Constraint Programming - Satisfiability) being used by Microsoft for datacenter VM placement and rack scheduling in production. CP-SAT is Google's constraint solver, which is open-source and available in the OR-Tools library, but based on these search results, I cannot confirm its use in Microsoft's production datacenter operations.\n\nWould you like me to search more specifically for:\n1. Microsoft's actual production scheduling systems and algorithms?\n2. Google's CP-SAT solver and its applications?\n3. Whether CP-SAT is used in cloud infrastructure scheduling?\n\nThis would help clarify the relationship between CP-SAT and Microsoft datacenter operations.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"cffb5657-0790-4ccf-87dd-62418a7c3186","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:11:57.464Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0c0bd1a8-792b-4cbf-b673-94ab69c3836f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"e333364a-9d23-4da7-ad98-4523dc946532","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0da025bf-5462-4d88-9ddf-73d39057a5ff","agentId":"a43e97232d861bfd4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DBCVJBfZGhjpZ1G71CJexq","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"or-tools\" production \"we run\" cron daily nightly batch job optimization scheduling experience\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Understanding Cron Jobs and Batch Jobs in DevOps - DEV Community\",\"url\":\"https://dev.to/574n13y/understanding-cron-jobs-and-batch-jobs-in-devops-14lf\"},{\"title\":\"Distinctive batch scheduling software for hybrid IT\",\"url\":\"https://www.redwood.com/workload-automation/job-scheduling/batch-scheduling/\"},{\"title\":\"Comparison of 11 Best Batch Scheduling Software in 2024\",\"url\":\"https://www.softwaretestingmaterial.com/batch-scheduling-software/\"},{\"title\":\"Job scheduling with Unix: The best alternatives to cron\",\"url\":\"https://www.redwood.com/article/job-scheduling-with-unix/\"},{\"title\":\"Top 10 Batch Scheduling Software: Features, Pros & Cons\",\"url\":\"https://research.aimultiple.com/batch-scheduling-software/\"},{\"title\":\"Enterprise Batch Scheduling Software Comparison Guide\",\"url\":\"https://www.advsyscon.com/activebatch/job-scheduling/batch-scheduling/\"},{\"title\":\"Python Cron Job and Job Scheduler: Smarter Scheduling Options\",\"url\":\"https://www.advsyscon.com/blog/python-job-scheduling/\"},{\"title\":\"Top 12 Open Source Job Schedulers & 5 WLA Tools\",\"url\":\"https://aimultiple.com/open-source-job-scheduler\"},{\"title\":\"How Cron Job Scheduling Automation Simplifies Your Workflows | ActiveBatch Blog\",\"url\":\"https://www.advsyscon.com/blog/cron-job-scheduling/\"},{\"title\":\"Cron Expression Builder Guide: Create Scheduled Tasks Like a Pro - DEV Community\",\"url\":\"https://dev.to/_d7eb1c1703182e3ce1782/cron-expression-builder-guide-create-scheduled-tasks-like-a-pro-13p9\"}]\n\nI searched for information about \"or-tools\" production cron daily batch job optimization scheduling, but the search results don't contain specific information about OR-Tools (Google's Operations Research library) in production environments or real-world experiences running cron jobs, nightly batches, or optimization scheduling with OR-Tools.\n\nThe search results I found focus on general batch scheduling software, cron jobs, job schedulers, and workload automation tools like ActiveBatch, Redwood, and others—but they don't specifically address OR-Tools or companies sharing their experiences using OR-Tools for production cron or batch job optimization.\n\nTo get more relevant information, I could search with a more specific query focused directly on OR-Tools production use cases. Would you like me to do that, or would you prefer information about something specific related to batch scheduling and optimization tools in general?\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"fcd89d32-e553-48ee-9a4a-51eb09a8f14e","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:11:58.518Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e333364a-9d23-4da7-ad98-4523dc946532","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"b05d16c6-926f-49c3-8e26-e1e916a5f10a","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0da025bf-5462-4d88-9ddf-73d39057a5ff","agentId":"a43e97232d861bfd4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DZ2x3s5Zt77AxaNmDLurFG","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Google \"CP-SAT\" internal use cases YouTube talk Frederic Didier\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"The CP-SAT-LP Solver (Invited Talk) - DROPS\",\"url\":\"https://drops.dagstuhl.de/entities/document/10.4230/LIPIcs.CP.2023.3\"},{\"title\":\"🎓 How the CP-SAT solver works | Just another developer\",\"url\":\"https://xiang.es/posts/explaining-cp-sat/\"},{\"title\":\"CP-SAT for scheduling Laurent Perron (lperron@google.com)\",\"url\":\"https://schedulingseminar.com/presentations/SchedulingSeminar_LaurentPerron.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Introduction - The CP-SAT Primer - Using and Understanding Google OR-Tools' CP-SAT Solver\",\"url\":\"https://d-krupke.github.io/cpsat-primer/\"},{\"title\":\"OR-Tools Laurent Perron (lperron@google.com)\",\"url\":\"https://egon.cheme.cmu.edu/ewo/docs/CP-SAT%20and%20OR-Tools.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"The CP-SAT-LP Solver Laurent Perron # Google, Paris, France Frédéric Didier #\",\"url\":\"https://drops.dagstuhl.de/storage/00lipics/lipics-vol280-cp2023/LIPIcs.CP.2023.3/LIPIcs.CP.2023.3.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"\\\"DecisionBuilder\\\" for CP-SAT solver?\",\"url\":\"https://groups.google.com/g/or-tools-discuss/c/AealBKhjxUU\"},{\"title\":\"dblp: Frédéric Didier\",\"url\":\"https://dblp.org/pid/99/1444.html\"},{\"title\":\"Frédéric didier\",\"url\":\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=oiTUP8IAAAAJ&hl=en\"},{\"title\":\"CPAIOR 2020 Master Class: Constraint Programming - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lmy1ddn4cyw\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found relevant information about CP-SAT and Frédéric Didier's work:\n\nThere is a Master Class Session on CP-SAT from the OR-Tools suite by Laurent Perron and Frédéric Didier presented at CPAIOR 2020, which is available on YouTube at https://youtu.be/lmy1ddn4cyw.\n\nThe CP-SAT-LP solver is developed by the Operations Research team at Google and is part of the OR-Tools open-source optimization suite. It is an implementation of a purely integral Constraint Programming solver on top of a SAT solver using Lazy Clause Generation.\n\nAdditionally, Laurent Perron, Frédéric Didier, and Steven Gay presented \"The CP-SAT-LP Solver\" as an invited talk at the 29th International Conference on Principles and Practice of Constraint Programming (CP 2023).\n\nHowever, the search results do not specifically contain details about Google's internal use cases for CP-SAT as discussed in a YouTube talk. The CPAIOR 2020 Master Class may cover some of this information, but you would need to watch the full presentation at the YouTube link provided above to see the specific internal use cases discussed by Didier and Perron.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"21d8915a-0501-4e8b-8e8d-a33cfc741568","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:11:58.636Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b05d16c6-926f-49c3-8e26-e1e916a5f10a","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
